{"suttaId":"tha-ap478","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[1709,1723],"vripara":"56"},"segments":{"tha-ap478:0.3":"Kusaṭṭhakadāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap478:1.1":"“Kassapassa bhagavato, brāhmaṇassa vusīmato;","tha-ap478:1.3":"Pasannacitto sumano, kusaṭṭhakamadāsahaṃ.","tha-ap478:2.1":"“Imasmiṃyeva kappasmiṃ, kusaṭṭhakamadāsahaṃ;","tha-ap478:2.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, kusaṭṭhakassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap478:3.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap478:4.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap478:5.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap478:6.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā kusaṭṭhakadāyako thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap478:7.1":"Kusaṭṭhakadāyakattherassāpadānaṃ chaṭṭhaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
